,0.683,0.66,0.557,0.138,0.603,0.505,0.63,0.413,0.143,0.838,0.592,0.326,0.041,0.01,0.067,0.257,0.728,0.501,0.61,0.579,0.544,0.87,0.127,0.474,0.372,0.288,0.221,0.229,0.212,0.178,0.178,0.216,0.208,0.202,0.1,0.021],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"NARRATOR: As Cye approaches the perimeter of the scene, he sees a beat cop taking statements from citizens. Cye pays him little mind and keeps walking towards the transit hub. The cop quickly stops what he’s doing and blocks Cye’s path.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.48,"end":13.664,"frac":0.78,"status":"ok","matched":32,"words":41},"large":{"start":0.48,"end":13.664,"frac":0.854,"status":"ok","matched":35,"words":41},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"BEAT COP: Hey buddy, what are you doing here? Whole hub’s shut down for another half day at least.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":14.24,"end":20.192,"frac":0.842,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":19},"large":{"start":14.24,"end":20.192,"frac":0.842,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":19},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"CYE: I see – and what would you suggest to a poor citizen just trying to get to their daily employment? Don’t you have a buggy, sir? Aren’t you here to serve the people?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":20.576,"end":30.0,"frac":0.97,"status":"ok","matched":32,"words":33},"large":{"start":20.576,"end":30.08,"frac":0.97,"status":"ok","matched":32,"words":33},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"NARRATOR: Cye gestures to the two pedestrians watching their interaction with glazed eyes.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":30.0,"end":35.168,"frac":0.846,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":13},"large":{"start":30.656,"end":35.168,"frac":0.846,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":13},"differ":true},{"i":4,"text":"BEAT COP: …With respect, sir, I can’t help you with that.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":36.192,"end":39.328,"frac":0.818,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":11},"large":{"start":36.192,"end":39.328,"frac":0.818,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":11},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"CYE: Never mind good buddy, my pal, because I am in fact not a poor citizen inconvenienced.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":39.808,"end":44.864,"frac":0.941,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":17},"large":{"start":39.808,"end":44.864,"frac":0.941,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":17},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"NARRATOR: Cye gestures to the inspector’s insignia on his jacket.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":45.312,"end":48.736,"frac":0.8,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":10},"large":{"start":45.312,"end":48.736,"frac":0.8,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":10},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"BEAT COP: You could have just shown that to me first…","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":49.152,"end":52.48,"frac":0.818,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":11},"large":{"start":49.152,"end":52.48,"frac":0.818,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":11},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"CYE: Indeed, it was under your nose the whole time. Here, I bought croissants. Have one.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":52.96,"end":57.472,"frac":0.938,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":16},"large":{"start":52.96,"end":57.472,"frac":0.938,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":16},"differ":false},{"i":9,"text":"BEAT COP: So glad a professional is leading this case. Let me bring you to the coroner.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":58.368,"end":64.032,"frac":0.882,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":17},"large":{"start":58.368,"end":64.032,"frac":0.882,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":17},"differ":false},{"i":10,"text":"NARRATOR: The beat cop brings Cye to the edge of the scene and lifts the police tape for him, gesturing to the Coroner draped in medical scrubs.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":64.576,"end":72.288,"frac":0.926,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":27},"large":{"start":64.576,"end":72.288,"frac":0.926,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":27},"differ":false},{"i":11,"text":"CYE: Morning, my friend! A flaky crescent for you?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":72.864,"end":75.808,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"large":{"start":72.864,"end":75.808,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":12,"text":"CORONER: Come on, man. You don’t bring breakfast to a dead guy.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":76.32,"end":79.808,"frac":0.917,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":12},"large":{"start":76.32,"end":79.808,"frac":0.917,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":12},"differ":false},{"i":13,"text":"CYE: It’s not for them, it’s for you, dear coroner.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":80.128,"end":82.464,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":10},"large":{"start":80.128,"end":82.464,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":10},"differ":false},{"i":14,"text":"CORONER: Huh. Well, thanks! You’re new.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":82.976,"end":86.08,"frac":0.5,"status":"ok","matched":3,"words":6},"large":{"start":82.976,"end":85.96,"frac":0.667,"status":"ok","matched":4,"words":6},"differ":false},{"i":15,"text":"CYE: I’ve been around! We must have missed each other – like ships, in the night. Why don’t you tell me what went wrong with the Propulsor?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":86.08,"end":93.088,"frac":0.962,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":26},"large":{"start":85.96,"end":93.08,"frac":0.962,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":26},"differ":false},{"i":16,"text":"CORONER: The transport? Not the guy?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":93.312,"end":95.392,"frac":0.833,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":6},"large":{"start":93.312,"end":95.392,"frac":0.833,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":6},"differ":false},{"i":17,"text":"CYE: There should be failsafes in place no matter HOW fast this fellow supposedly jumped. Let me take a look.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":95.968,"end":101.248,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":20},"large":{"start":95.968,"end":101.248,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":20},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6ab6d97cb455c_5-1c.jpg"}